The [[toh:tp-link:start|TP-Link]] RE305 is a wall-pluggable dual-band wireless range extender (802.11b/g/n and 802.11a/n/ac) based on the MediaTek SoCs with a Fast Ethernet port. The RE305v1 is based on a MediaTek MT7628AN SoC. The device has 8 MiB flash and 64 MiB ram.

There is an issue with certain versions, see [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/please-change-on-openwrt-https-openwrt-org-toh-tp-link-re305-v1-the-version-that-works-on-tp-link-re305-v1-device-that-is-according-to-user-iozone-is-only-works-well/161328/7?u=lleachii|the forum thread]] for details.

